                                "sense_id": "6460b3e7-61d0-33d7-b431-9456873ca692",
                                "text": "Lady O'Dowd is also so attached to it that, she says, if anything were to happen to Mick, bedad she'd come back and marry some of 'em."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e82e7f6-af19-41cf-b74b-369e571a9c72",
                                "sense_id": "6460b3e7-61d0-33d7-b431-9456873ca692",
                                "text": "But as for the party, bedad, it's rotten to the core, and won't stand another session."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "949170cf-a4a3-47ec-90b0-39488a942b23",
                                "sense_id": "6460b3e7-61d0-33d7-b431-9456873ca692",
                                "text": "\"Ah, bedad, ye can finish it yourself--it's too expansive for me!\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8321c002-3ad4-4d4a-ad5e-ecca93705b7e",
                                "sense_id": "6460b3e7-61d0-33d7-b431-9456873ca692",
                                "text": "May I tempt you to a little more filleted lemon sole, miss Dubedat? Yes, do bedad. And she did bedad."
                            }
                        ]
